 1. The Role Tree HierarchyThe system organizes roles in a strict institutional tree hierarchy, descending from strategic oversight to field execution and security validation.Plaintext🏛️ Debre Markos University (DMU) Central Management
 └── 🛡️ 1. SYSTEM ADMINISTRATOR (Root Access)
      │    ├── User & Role Management (CRUD Accounts)
      │    ├── System Security & Audit Logging
      │    └── Global System Configuration & Backups
      │
      ├── 📦 2. PROPERTY ADMIN DIRECTORATE / STOCK OFFICER (Central Governance)
      │    ├── Global Asset Registry Management (Add/Edit/Archive)
      │    ├── Inter-Campus & Inter-College Asset Transfers
      │    ├── Annual Stock Reconciliation & Discrepancy Audits
      │    ├── Straight-Line Depreciation Calculation
      │    └── Public Asset Disposal (Auction, Scrap, Donation)
      │
      ├── 🎓 3. DEPARTMENT HEAD / DEAN (College & Unit Administration)
      │    ├── Departmental Asset Inventory Management
      │    ├── Requisition & Equipment Transfer Requests
      │    ├── Local Asset Handover Approvals
      │    └── Maintenance Ticket Submissions
      │
      ├── 🔧 4. MAINTENANCE & IT TECHNICIAN (Operational Service)
      │    ├── Repair Ticket Workorders & Diagnosis
      │    ├── Repair Status Updates (Pending ➔ In Progress ➔ Completed)
      │    ├── Repair Cost & Spare Parts Expense Logging (ETB)
      │    └── Asset Disposal Feasibility Recommendation
      │
      └── 🛂 5. GATE SECURITY OFFICER (Physical Gate Guarding)
           ├── Digital Gate Pass QR Code Scanning
           ├── Transit Clearance (Check-in / Check-out)
           └── Handover Voucher & Driver Verification